  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 5,000 gp (lesser), 10,000 gp (normal), 20,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 1 sp</p>\n<p>You can alter a talent with a range of close, medium, or long to increase its range by 100%. An enlarged talent with a range of close now has a range of 50 feet + 5 feet/ level, while medium-range spells have a range of 200 feet + 20 feet/level and long-range spells have a range of 800 feet + 80 feet/level. Talents whose ranges are not defined by distance, as well as talents whose ranges are not close, medium, or long, do not benefit from this effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Enlarging Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 2,500 gp (lesser), 5,000 gp (normal), 10,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser tier; held slender rod. Use as part of casting a qualifying sphere effect while holding this apparatus in at least one hand. The effect must be caster level seven or lower. Spend one of 3 daily uses; only one metamagic apparatus may apply per casting. Its feat’s extra spell-point and casting-time costs are waived, but normal effect and other-metamagic costs still apply.</p><p>Double only close, medium or long ranges, including their per-level increments. Non-distance ranges and other range categories do not benefit.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>. Feat Cost applies to taking the feat, not using the physical apparatus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
